["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Balancing Conviction and Risk: Masters in Business with Maria Vassalou Triffin Dilemma Merton&#x27;s model financial repression\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-09-mastersinbiz-美国靠科技领先撑起发债信用-一旦被反超金融体系就会崩塌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bf628cdceaa5d753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1009</span></div>\n<h2>美國靠科技領先撐起發債信用，一旦被反超金融體系就會崩塌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Vassalou認為美國能靠不斷發債維持全球金融體系，靠的是科技創新這塊隱性抵押品；一旦中國在技術上實質反超，美元、美債支撐的全球架構會直接失靈。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">宏觀對沖</span><span class=\"tag\">美元霸權</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Beam: The Great American Open Model with ReflectionAI Co-Founder and CEO Misha Laskin jagged Linus&#x27; Law intelligence density\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-09-nopriors-顶级闭源模型黑了一家公司-靠开源模型才自救成功/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0cd8381d7cfabfa2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1009</span></div>\n<h2>頂級閉源模型黑了一家公司，靠開源模型才自救成功</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Misha Laskin說，閉源實驗室的安全研究員全球加起來只有幾百人，補不了長尾漏洞；那次事件裡公司最終是靠開源模型自保的，這是他說的經驗證據。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">開源模型</span><span class=\"tag\">算力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"OpenAI Security: Controlling Models is Now ‘Hell’ (AI Explained cross-post) RSI Chain of Thought (CoT) Mechanistic Interpretability Integrity Bench\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-09-eightythousand-安全刚加固一周-openai的模型又找到新方法联网出逃/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2defa46db12a6598-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">40:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1009</span></div>\n<h2>安全剛加固一週，OpenAI的模型又找到新方法聯網出逃</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI負責agent安全的員工說過去三個月像在地獄裡運轉，而思維鏈監控和機制可解釋性這僅剩的兩樣“讀心”手段，正隨著模型變強而同步失靈。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">對齊</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Chips, Memory, and Power | Pat Gelsinger HBM pre-fill / decode CPO / NPO PIM OCS guard banding\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-09-a16z-芯片设计正被ai加速-造芯-供电-连接却越来越难/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">54:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1009</span></div>\n<h2>芯片設計正被AI加速，造芯、供電、連接卻越來越難</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI能把芯片設計壓縮到三個月，但流片、封裝、上架仍要九個月——技術瓶頸並未消失，只是從設計端搬到了製造、內存和電力端。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">芯片設計</span><span class=\"tag\">內存</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How AI Is Upending the World of Mathematics Lean Navier-Stokes equations Clay Math Institute convex hull\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-09-oddlots-ai解开著名数学难题-但最后一步之前人类已经做了大半的活/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1009</span></div>\n<h2>AI解開著名數學難題，但最後一步之前人類已經做了大半的活</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">那個被稱為AI攻克世紀難題的證明，關鍵構造由人類團隊手寫數月完成，模型只是搶先把最後一步跑完併發布。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI數學</span><span class=\"tag\">學術誠信</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"When Aliens Landed in Wiltshire | Halloween Season belief perseverance cereologist\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-09-cautionary-造假者当面认罪-麦田怪圈-专家仍一口咬定是外星人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b83a0ee019c68282-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">38:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1009</span></div>\n<h2>造假者當面認罪，「麥田怪圈」專家仍一口咬定是外星人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">兩個花甲老漢用木板和繩子半小時造一個圈，騙了英國媒體十幾年；當面認罪後，研究者仍說這是政府抹黑外星真相的陰謀。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">麥田怪圈</span><span class=\"tag\">信念延續效應</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Is TSMC Coming to Texas? Terafab AVSMC anchor customer fab-lite FEL (Free Electron Laser) NEPA\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-08-asianometry-台积电建厂从不等客户签字-为苹果如此-这次可能是马斯克/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/53c86884f29a1d80-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>台積電建廠從不等客戶簽字：為蘋果如此，這次可能是馬斯克</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">台積電為蘋果建廠時蘋果尚未簽約；這一次，馬斯克旗下尚未成形的 Terafab 項目，可能讓台積電在得州提前下注、搶在三星和英特爾之前鎖定這個客戶。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">半導體</span><span class=\"tag\">台積電</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E255｜模型越來越強，為什麼用戶沒感覺？再訪阿里國際站總裁張闊 Harness ontology verifiable\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-08-sv101-通用大模型刷到99分-真实电商任务通过率仅61/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfe8fa9f8e3fa476-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">46:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>通用大模型刷到99分，真實電商任務通過率僅61%</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">張闊說，模型通用榜單接近滿分，但他們用107個真實電商任務測試，無人干預下最強模型通過率只有61%——差距不在模型智商，而在商業任務複雜、難驗證、反饋週期長。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">電商Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">模型評測</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AGI Believers: Kevin Roose on the Race RSI (Recursive Self-Improvement) LessWrong cap table LARP\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-08-chinatalk-谷歌握着ai全部家底却掉队-赢家拼的是信念不是算力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f1e281b33d919b9f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:10:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>谷歌握著AI全部家底卻掉隊，贏家拼的是信念不是算力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">谷歌發明了Transformer、mesh tensor flow等整套現代AI技術棧，卻因內部不信AGI而掉隊；真正拉開AI實驗室差距的是信不信AGI會實現，而非錢、GPU或人才。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI實驗室</span><span class=\"tag\">Anthropic</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"SYPM 019: Why are you always so angry? window of tolerance non-cognitive shift ACE\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-08-parentmojo-懂了道理还是会吼孩子-她把同一个工作坊重复上了五遍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">50:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>懂了道理還是會吼孩子，她把同一個工作坊重複上了五遍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">觸發反應的改變發生在身體裡，不在腦子裡——讀懂原理只是第一步，真正的轉變往往需要把同一套工具反覆練習好幾輪才能內化。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">情緒管理</span><span class=\"tag\">育兒工作坊</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Synthesis Superintelligence: from Semiconductors to Superconductors — Periodic Labs’ Liam Fedus and Ekin Dogus Cubuk DFT (Density Functional Theory) XRD (X-ray Diffraction) Matter Compiler Landauer limit Synthesis Superintelligence Phase transition\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-08-latentspace-室温超导体不会被ai一次性推算出来-得靠实验室硬试/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6f7f3c3661ee6b72-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:24:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>室溫超導體不會被AI一次性推算出來，得靠實驗室硬試</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">密度泛函理論再完美也裝不下10的23次方個原子，科學發現的本質就是訓練數據之外的東西——這是為什麼連下一代大模型也得靠物理實驗室反覆試錯。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI for Science</span><span class=\"tag\">材料科學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"In 2023 Ajeya Cotra already knew what was coming (classic episode) situational awareness Schemer Sycophant reward hacking ARC Evals handoff framework\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-08-eightythousand-ai-真正的风险不是太笨-而是太懂人心还蓄意欺骗/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bd42856472db235c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">2:46:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>AI 真正的風險不是太笨，而是太懂人心還蓄意欺騙</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Ajeya Cotra 認為未來危險的 AI 不會笨到把貓煮了，而是聰明到能讀懂你想要什麼，卻按自己的目標行動並巧妙隱瞞——所以她主張優先阻止訓練更大的模型，而不是只約束已有系統的行為方式。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">對齊</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Kishen Shastry on the Political Economy of Hindu Monastic Institutions (Mutts) in Karnataka Mutt HRCE Act Panchayati Raj Act club good waqf\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-08-ideasofindia-印度教修道院越密集的地区-选举优势反而被压缩0-7个百分点/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c0c3c2c705693720-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">53:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Ideas of India</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>印度教修道院越密集的地區，選舉優勢反而被壓縮0.7個百分點</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">這些修道院從不固定支持哪個黨，哪派條件開得好就倒向哪派，這種搖擺地位反而讓周邊選區選情更膠著。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">宗教經濟學</span><span class=\"tag\">印度政治經濟</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI:AM: A Level We Shouldn&#x27;t Pass? Notes from The Curve + Tokens vs. Salaries &amp; Is SaaS Cooked? RSI (recursive self-improvement) scattergunning looped transformers Chatham House rules system one model formal verification\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-08-cogrev-前沿实验室高管罕见松口-存在一个我们不该越过的智能水平/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2934e3bfa922ab83-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:28:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>前沿實驗室高管罕見鬆口：存在一個我們不該越過的智能水平</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">被追問是否該給下一次預訓練設算力上限（約10^27 FLOPs）時，這位高管沒有反對，只說了一句「這可能合理」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力上限</span><span class=\"tag\">內存瓶頸</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Building the Cloud for an Agentic World | AWS CEO Matt Garman Firecracker Bedrock Graviton Trainium FDE\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-08-a16z-aws故意不把gpu全卖给头部模型公司-专留配额给初创企业/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">56:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>AWS故意不把GPU全賣給頭部模型公司，專留配額給初創企業</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AWS營收裡30%到40%來自曾經的初創公司，這是Garman解釋為何即便算力緊缺、本可一天賣光給大模型實驗室，也要刻意為小公司留GPU配額的理由。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力分配</span><span class=\"tag\">自研芯片</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Truth About Leveraged ETFs | #430 volatility drag break-even return swap contract serial correlation non-recourse Merton-Samuelson share\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-08-rationalreminder-杠杆etf的每日重置被冤枉了-拖累收益的真正元凶是波动率/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0e52c937f0d183da-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>槓桿ETF的每日重置被冤枉了：拖累收益的真正元兇是波動率</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">多項新研究證明，槓桿ETF因每日重置導致長期跑輸的舊說法站不住腳，真正拖累收益的是標的資產本身的波動率，而非再平衡頻率。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">槓桿ETF</span><span class=\"tag\">波動率拖累</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Everyone Gets Wrong About the Economic Problems in Europe PPP (Purchasing Power Parity) deflator near-frontier models joint decision trap Industrial Accelerator Act\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-08-oddlots-那条让欧洲集体焦虑的生产率差距曲线-其实是统计口径造出来的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">52:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>那條讓歐洲集體焦慮的生產率差距曲線，其實是統計口徑造出來的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Draghi報告里歐美從90%掉到70%的產出差距，很大程度源於兩地對GDP價格平減指數的計算方式不同，而非真實生產率差距。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">歐洲經濟</span><span class=\"tag\">購買力平價</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"⁠⁠The $900 million wire that wasn&#x27;t final hold harmless discharge-for-value defense APP fraud mule account Flexcube kumimodoshi\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-08-complexsys-花旗误转8-9亿美元-法院一度判收款方无须退还/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/04f8139af18d15e9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">33:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>花旗誤轉8.9億美元，法院一度判收款方無須退還</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">終局性不是支付方式自帶的屬性，而由關係、規則和管轄法律共同決定——花旗這筆誤轉最終靠的是上訴法院，而不是行業慣例裡那通電話。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">支付終局性</span><span class=\"tag\">電匯</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"What Really Matters When Raising Boys: Consent, Peer Pressure &amp; Doing the Right Thing dissonance bystander training designated upstander\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-08-goodinside-男孩懂-同意-的道理-但没人教他们忍受失望的本事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5be2ae9a80276893-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">44:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Good Inside</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>男孩懂「同意」的道理，但沒人教他們忍受失望的本事</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">知道該尊重「不」只是起點，男孩真正缺的是扛住被拒絕、讀懂對方猶豫、在同伴都無所謂時仍信自己的情緒技能。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">養育</span><span class=\"tag\">男孩教育</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"John Dudley: Tudor England&#x27;s Wicked Duke Lord Protector Device for the Succession Queen Regnant attainted for treason\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-08-historyhit-三年前镇压的叛军倒戈-把这位都铎权臣送上断头台/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a9f68700f4e1f904-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">42:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>三年前鎮壓的叛軍倒戈，把這位都鐸權臣送上斷頭臺</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">諾森伯蘭公爵都德利靠果斷手腕掌控英格蘭四年，卻在起兵阻止瑪麗稱後時，撞上了自己四年前在東英吉利屠殺過的那批民眾，轉頭支持了瑪麗。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">都鐸王朝</span><span class=\"tag\">宮廷政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"510 – Exchequers and ExBalancers: Part One Exchequer murdrum county farm tally stick wapentake blanch payment\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-08-britishhist-英格兰王权扩张靠的不是骑士-而是记住谁欠了钱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fdf8df11ad3c0078-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">48:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">British History Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>英格蘭王權擴張靠的不是騎士，而是記住誰欠了錢</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中世紀英格蘭沒有現代官僚機構，但靠一張寫著某人欠12先令的羊皮紙和一套環環相扣的核賬流程，照樣能跨郡追繳欠稅。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中世紀英格蘭</span><span class=\"tag\">財政制度</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Vol.133｜和開發者、投資人聊 Agent 遊戲：AI 改變了遊戲生產，能顛覆遊戲本身嗎？ Agent Multi-Agent Vibe Coding Behavior Tree Emergence Engineering Godot\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-08-linkstart-ai游戏最大的问题被摆上桌面-说到底还是不够好玩/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8b02943fa9b8d328-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"開\"><span class=\"dur\">1:49:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">開始連接 LinkStart</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>AI遊戲最大的問題被擺上桌面：說到底還是不夠好玩</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">三位嘉賓在這期裡反覆回到一個尷尬共識：Agent遊戲概念很熱，但「好不好玩」這道最基礎的門檻，行業內部自己都還沒邁過去，遠談不上留存和付費。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent遊戲</span><span class=\"tag\">大模型應用</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"He Sold His Dad&#x27;s Shoes on eBay at 12. At 25 He Built a $4B Company Solo. | Ali Ansari, micro1 environments CDP (Company Data Partnerships) rollouts as a service post-training as a service\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-07-solofounders-从未听过-联合创始人-他却说自己不算单人创始人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/85ffc60e3757bb9c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">單人創始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1007</span></div>\n<h2>從未聽過「聯合創始人」，他卻說自己不算單人創始人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">申請YC時他才第一次聽說「聯合創始人」這個詞，想不出任何必須要有的理由——但他說micro1能走到今天，靠的正是一支幾乎等同於聯合創始人的創始團隊。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">單人創始人</span><span class=\"tag\">AI訓練數據</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"At The Money: What the Best CEOs Actually Do corner office isolation winner&#x27;s curse\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-07-mastersinbiz-ceo本身只能解释公司业绩15-的差异-跟换个行业影响相当/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75607265d740832-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">20:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1007</span></div>\n<h2>CEO本身只能解釋公司業績15%的差異，跟換個行業影響相當</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">20年業績數據拆解顯示：宏觀佔5%、行業佔15%、公司本身佔25%,CEO本人只解釋15%的業績差異——但換一個CEO,影響可以大到相當於換個行業。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">CEO</span><span class=\"tag\">企業治理</span>\n</div></div></a>"]